{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Pixpipe 是一款為網上轉售者與小店而設的 iPhone 商品相片處理工具，拍下貨品相片後可批量去背、換上乾淨背景，並統一方形構圖，讓每張商品頁相片風格一致。程式現正推出終生版<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $39.99，內購限時免費，適合需要處理大量貨品相片的用戶。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-79.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>批量去背整理商品相片</h2>\n<p>Pixpipe 以 Apple 裝置端 Vision 引擎自動抽出主體，可放到純白、柔灰、自訂顏色或漸變背景，加入柔和接觸陰影，再置中於方形畫布，符合網購平台構圖需要。儲存前可用擦除與還原筆刷微調邊緣。由去背、換背景、裁切、加水印、改名到匯出可一次批量完成，另支援 ZIP 匯出、Brand Kit 一鍵套用、EXIF 移除與格式轉換。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-99-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-100-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-101-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-102-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-103-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-104-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>Pixpipe 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Pixpipe</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/pixpipe/id6761884516\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T07:58:06.483302+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":456,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T03:41:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T08:18:47.802024+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T07:51:53.150543+00:00","content_hash":"baf5c8ba22fc9aef46e6ebf561dab121872e33c603b897ad558e0208762b2397","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}